                                "sense_id": "2c50c55a-4736-37f5-9888-d99d8bc2d8d1",
                                "text": "One of the pioneers was a French plant scientist named Georges Morel who figured out how to produce asexually thousands of identical orchids from one plant through cloning instead of breeding from seed."
